<!-- ===== 维度一：阅读与文字识别 ===== -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">01</div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-title">阅读与文字识别</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">评估对书面文字的解码、识别与理解能力</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q1">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">1.</span>阅读时，您是否会无意中跳行、重复读同一行，或丢失阅读位置？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="1" data-dim="reading"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q2">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">2.</span>阅读时，您是否感觉文字在纸上"移动"、模糊、重叠，或产生视觉干扰？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="2" data-dim="reading"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q3">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">3.</span>读完一段文字后，您是否经常记不住刚才读了什么，需要重读才能理解？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="3" data-dim="reading"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q4">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">4.</span>朗读时，您是否经常读错字、跳字，或将形近字混淆（如"己/已/巳"）？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="4" data-dim="reading"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q5">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">5.</span>与同龄人相比，您的阅读速度是否明显偏慢，或同样内容需要花费更多时间？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="5" data-dim="reading"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== 维度二：书写与拼写 ===== -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">02</div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-title">书写与拼写</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">评估文字书写、字形记忆与书面表达能力</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q6">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">6.</span>书写时，您是否常常写出字形错误的字（笔画多写或少写、结构颠倒混乱）？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="6" data-dim="writing"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q7">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">7.</span>即使知道一个字的读音，您是否仍难以回忆起它的正确写法？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="7" data-dim="writing"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q8">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">8.</span>您是否会将字母、数字或偏旁方向写反（如"b/d"、"6/9"、"土/士"）？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="8" data-dim="writing"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q9">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">9.</span>写文章或邮件时，即使思路清晰，是否也很难将想法准确转化为书面文字？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="9" data-dim="writing"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== 维度三：语音处理 ===== -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">03</div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-title">语音处理与听觉</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">评估语音意识、音节处理与听觉工作记忆</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q10">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">10.</span>您是否觉得很难把一个词按音节拆开，或辨认出押韵/同音词？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="10" data-dim="phonology"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q11">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">11.</span>听别人说一长串信息（电话号码、地址、指令）时，您是否容易记混或遗漏？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="11" data-dim="phonology"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q12">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">12.</span>在嘈杂环境中，您是否比其他人更难听清楚别人说的话？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="12" data-dim="phonology"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q13">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">13.</span>您是否常将听到的词误听为发音相似的另一个词（如"制度"听成"秩序"）？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="13" data-dim="phonology"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>

</div>

<!-- ===== 维度四：工作记忆 ===== -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">04</div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-title">工作记忆与信息处理</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">评估短时记忆容量、顺序处理与认知负荷耐受</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q14">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">14.</span>做事中途被打断后，您是否常忘记自己做到哪一步，需要重头检查？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="14" data-dim="memory"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q15">
    <div class="q-text"><span class="q-num">15.</span>您是否难以记住一串数字（手机号、账号），总是需要反复查看？</div>
    <div class="options" data-q="15" data-dim="memory"></div>
    <div class="scale-labels"><span>从不</span><span>总是</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="question" id="q16">
